window.products.push({"id":819193,"name":"Brieftons Safe Mandoline Slicer for Kitchen, Injury-Free Design, 3 Cutting Modes & 2 Thickness Levels to Slice, Dice, Chop, Julienne Vegetables, with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y3EXU2F5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✓ COMPACT, EASY-TO-USE, SAFE MANDOLINE SLICER: Tired of spending too much time prepping vegetables? Do you own a vegetable mandoline slicer that is ineffective or hazardous to use due to sharp, exposed blades? The Brieftons VSafe Mandoline Slicer might just be the answer for you. It sets a new benchmark in safety for mandoline slicers, with totally concealed blades, 3 cutting modes & 2 slicing thicknesses. This mandolin cutter slicer can help improve your productivity many times in the kitchen. ✓ VERSATILE: Cutting and chopping veggies into beautiful garnishes is now as easy as pushing a handle. With 3 different cutting modes (Slice, Dice, Julienne) & 2 slicing thicknesses (2mm and 4mm), this standup multifunctional vegetable cutter is a highly versatile tool that can help you create many cutting styles from ordinary vegetables and fruits. Not only is it a mandoline slicer, it's also a dicer, chopper, cutter, julienne slicer all in one compact, safe, user friendly device. ✓ UTMOST SAFETY: Slice, dice, chop or julienne vegetables / fruits by simply pushing down on the recoiled handle. Blades are all concealed for your utmost safety. Unlike traditional mandoline slicers, this kitchen chopping artifact can prep your vegetables/fruits quickly & safely without risks of finger injuries, all thanks to its unique, innovative safety design. Made of food safe ABS plastic & premium stainless steel blades | EASY TO STORE: Foldable feet for compact storage. ✓ GREAT VALUE: Bundle includes the mandoline slicer, 3 blade inserts (Slicer insert, Fine Julienne insert, Coarse Julienne insert), container to collect chopped foods, keep-fresh lid to keep chopped foods fresh for longer in the container, cleaning brush to safely clean the blades, printed user manual, and 5 bonus recipe Ebooks (downloadable) to get you started right away | EASY CLEANING: Components come apart for easy cleaning. A cleaning brush is provided to safely clean the blade inserts. ✓ A PERFECT GIFT FOR ALL OCCASIONS: What else can make a better gift for your loved ones than this gift of health. Perfect for moms, professional chefs, cooks, healthy-conscious individuals, cooking enthusiasts alike. Get ready to transform the way you prep your veggie with this multifunctional tool! ✓ BUY WITH CONFIDENCE: We are the trusted kitchen brand with thousands of happy customers. You get a full unconditional money back guarantee if you are not happy with your mandoline slicer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Y3EXU2F5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brieftons","source_asin":"B09KN2V5DC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-819193","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KN2V5DC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KN2V5DC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":819194,"name":"Heavy Duty Coat Hat Robe Tool Towel Hook Rail Rack Wall Mount Storage Display Rustic Holder Architectural Reclaimed Organizer Kitchen Bathroom Foyer B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bb67Ou7FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Heavy duty and highly functional rack/rail perfect for any room and multi-purposes. Create extra organizational space by transforming empty wall with a uniquely functional work of handcrafted art into a versatile conversational piece. A great space-saving solution for every room in the house, garage, shop, barn, or outbuildings. Also a perfect entrance decor piece for businesses to welcome their customers and provide hanging space for coats, hats, scarves and umbrellas. Hand-crafted solid pine rail measuring 7\" tall, 3/4\" thick, and carefully finished with your chosen color. Super solid and sturdy hooks hand-forged from vintage/antique railroad spikes reclaimed from the railroads of the \"Wild West\" here in the Western USA. Some variations occur due to the hand made and reclaimed nature of these train spikes, but hook measurements are approx: 4-1/2\" tall, 2-1/2\" projection, 1-1/2\" by 1-1/4\" head/knob. Comes with matching mounting screws for quick and easy installation. Spacing between hook centers approx. 4\", and hooks approx. 2\" from the end of the rack.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Bb67Ou7FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RailroadSpikeArt™","source_asin":"B00PG5MANY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-819194","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00PG5MANY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00PG5MANY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
