window.products.push({"id":819232,"name":"1 Gallon Glass Drink Dispensers for Parties With Fruit Infuser,2 Pack Beverage Dispensers With Spigot Stainless Steel,Marker,Chalkboard,Mason Jar Drin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cc25jcetL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ALL-PURPOSE DISPENSER] The dispensers are well designed so that wherever you wish to use it you will surely give the best experience possible.Perfect for all kinds of liquids, and they're going to be your best liquid dispenser,As well as your container for daily drinks, sun tea,juice, water,milk,mixed lemonade, fruit punch,and cocktail. Additionally, they are going to be your laundry detergent container. has a large capacity of 1 gallon, with dimensions of 10.7''H, 6.8''W &4.2''W [DURABLE AND STURDY] These one gallon double glass beverage dispenser sets with spout are made of high-quality food-grade,clear,durable thick glass. they are easy to fill;simply unscrew the top lid,pour in the beverage of your choice, and replace the lid.the sealed environment will help the beverage stay fresh for a longer time.they are ideal for storage in the refrigerator,and it is easy to clean;just rinse it under lukewarm or cold water,or put it on the top rack of the dishwasher. [STAINLESS STEEL SPIGOT]Made of 18/8 stainless steel, metal not plastic;lead-free;leak-proof;resistant to corrosion;may be used for a very long period;two small rubber washers are included to provide a secure seal.it provides for a swift and constant flow,making it handy for you to use. additionally,it is easy to install.no tools are required;the nut since the spigot's straightforward design and attractive polished surface make it simple to maintain clean. [CHALKBOARD&FRUIT INFUSER]The glass dispensers comes along with a white marker, 2 hanging chalkboards, and a fruit infuser, allowing you to clearly label the many types of juices and fruits that are available. the writing on the chalkboard may be erased so that it can be used again, and you can even identify things in a creative way! the slim infuser ensures that fruit, ice cubes, and even sweets or edible flowers remain buried in the beverage, resulting in an exceptional level of taste. [SUITABLE FOR MANY OCCASIONS]The wide mouth beverage drink dispenser jug are suitable for use in any setting, including everyday use at home, birthday, weddings,firefighter parties celebrating christmas, thanksgiving, baby bridal showers,surprise parties, dinner parties, and picnics.beautiful modern made mason jar beverage pitcher form it will surely give a beautiful finish uplift look to your party or home dcor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Cc25jcetL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuguords","source_asin":"B0BHSZFJG8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-819232","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHSZFJG8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHSZFJG8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":819233,"name":"Sauder Carson Forge Library with Doors, Washington Cherry finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810AG0-TvnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Beautify your home with the rustic charm and simplistic design of this library with doors from the Carson Forge collection. This beautiful tall bookcase features three spacious shelves that are ideal for storing and displaying anything your little heart desires – from your collection of novels and work binders to knick-knacks and decorative plants. Its two adjustable shelves have the ability to move to different heights to create flexible storage options for items of all shapes and sizes. Behind its framed panel double doors is a hidden storage area that includes an adjustable shelf for additional space to stow away any household items you don't want to be seen around your house. Its classic beauty makes it a perfect fit for any room – the living room, your office, down the hallway or in the dining room. It looks good no matter where it stands! Finished in Washington Cherry and detailed with wrought iron style hardware, this stunning library is what you've always wanted.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810AG0-TvnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sauder","source_asin":"B00MGT1ZK2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-819233","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MGT1ZK2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MGT1ZK2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":819234,"name":"1994 to 1997 White House Christmas Ornaments, Sold as a Set of Four","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pDu187dzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This set includes the four White House Christmas ornaments produced from 1994 to 1997. These ornaments are no longer sold individually. 1994 Imperial Christmas, honoring James K. Polk, 11th President of the United States, 1845–49. The cameo at the center features an illustration of the President and Mrs. Polk on the South Lawn of the White House while they are serenaded by the United States Marine Band. 1995 A Patriotic Christmas, honoring Zachary Taylor, 12th President of the United States, 1849–50. The patriotic theme of this ornament is inspired by the ceremonies that President Taylor attended on the grounds of the Washington Monument on July 4, 1850. 1996 The Presidential Seal, honoring Millard Fillmore, 13th President of the United States, 1850–53. The earliest documented Presidential Seal was sketched by Fillmore and sent to Edward Stabler, a nationally renown seal engraver. The seal of the President of the United States is combined with an image of the North Portico of the White House. 1997 The White House Grounds, honoring Franklin Pierce, 14th President of the United States, 1853–57. The design of the ornament is inspired by the renovations and redecoration of the White House in 1853 and 1854. The fancy gilt frame, based upon the elaborate gold-leafed frames of two huge mirrors Pierce hung in the state parlors, symbolizes the rich character of the new furnishings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pDu187dzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"White House Historical Association","source_asin":"B00ED5FX96","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-819234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ED5FX96","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ED5FX96","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
