window.products.push({"id":819476,"name":"Ne'Qwa Art Hand Painted Blown Glass Winter Birch Snowman Ornament","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cGkJlGvNL._AC_.jpg","description":"This Ne'Qwa art ornament features a joyful smiling snowman and his Cardinal friend enjoying the beauty of a winter's day. A white birch background lends a woodsy feel, and a seasonal message can be found on the back. Meticulously crafted by artist Dona Gelsinger and Ne'Qwa art with the centuries-old technique of hand-painting in reverse on the inside of hand-blown glass. Includes a signed certificate of authenticity. Beautifully packaged in a satin-lined keepsake gift box, it makes a memorable Christmas gift for friends, loved ones and everyone who loves the magic and wonder found in the legends of St. Nick. An adjustable tassel cord allows for display on a Christmas tree or a stand. Fits walnut finish large stand 7000006, classic stand 7000007 and Trio stand 7000020. This beautiful Ne'Qwa art snowman ornament is approximately 5.5 inches high. Standard trillion shape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cGkJlGvNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ne'Qwa","source_asin":"B07JXVC2PR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-819476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JXVC2PR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JXVC2PR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
