window.products.push({"id":819585,"name":"uxcell Stretch Sofa Cover Chair Loveseat Couch Slipcover, Machine Washable, Stylish Furniture Covers with One Cushion Case Coffee White Large","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wqIkqwajL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Our sofa cover / loveseat cover and chair cover are made by form fitting stretch fabric.This sofa slipcover will perfect to your sofa / loveseat and chair from etc. This sofa covers not only your furniture ensuring it lasts for years to come, but also add luxurious new look or refresh your existing home decors.\n\n \nSofa size between:\n\nSmall: Chair-1seat Back Length 35-51 inches （90-130 cm) Approx\n\nMedium: Loveseat-2seats Back Length 53-67 inches (135-170 cm) Approx\n\nLarge: Sofa-3seats Back Length 69-86 inches (175-220 cm) Approx\n\nX-Large: Four Seater Back Length 88-114 inches (225-290 cm) Approx\n\n\n1 Free cushion cover size: 17 to 17 Inches( without the pillow inner)\n\n2. Normally, slipcover size should be slightly larger than the sofa size.\n\n\nHow to install:\n\nSteps 1: Position the slipcover over the sofa with the label at the back\n\nSteps 2: Pull the fabric evenly over the sofa, and push white sponge cylinders in spaces between the cushions, shaping the cover to the sofa and keeping fabric tight\n\nSteps 3: Tilt the sofa up and find elastic ties. Pull the front and back ties together tightly and tie. Pull the side ties together and tightly\n\nSteps 4: Put the sofa down and pll cover tight, pulling any excess fabric to the back\n\nSteps 5: Enjoy your newly coverd sofa!\n\n\nWarm prompt:\n\n-Due to the different size of the sofa gap, the foam pieces may sometimes not work very well when the gap is too big or too small.\n\nIf too small, we suggest that you can just put some waste clothes or towels in to the gap and do not need to use the foam pieces.\n\nIf too big, it will be better when you put waste clothes or towels in to the sofa gap with these foam pieces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wqIkqwajL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"uxcell","source_asin":"B08HPZN1YK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-819585","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HPZN1YK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HPZN1YK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
