window.products.push({"id":819607,"name":"BrightMiracle Steamer for Clothes, 1100W Portable Hand Held Steamers Fabrics Removes Wrinkles, 15-Second Fast Heat-up, Travel Garment Steamer with 280","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-5G5+AeGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Do you worry about the creases or wrinkles on your clothes every day? Is there an unpleasant smell just taking out the clothes from the closet? Are the curtains or carpets in the home difficult to clean? Hand-held iron can easily help you solve problems and make your home look new. 💨Multifunction ①3 steam modes： low, medium and high mode for you to choose, easily cope with wrinkles and creases. ②2 steam modes: Single spray: when locked, the machine is in standby state, press the button to exit the steam Continuous spraying: put down the lock, continue to lock the steam, no need to press when ironing 💨Safe and Leakproof Using unique leak-proof technology, you can hang clothes vertically or lie flat on the table for ironing. No need to worry about leaking. The widened bottom design allows you to put the iron directly on the table instead of placing it on a special iron like an ordinary iron. On the ironing pad. 💨Heat Insulation Gloves Steam ironing gloves are made of high temperature, scalding and water resistant polyester. There is a thick sponge inside to effectively insulate, and the waterproof surface isolates moisture. Breathable mesh design keeps your hands dry and prevents sweating after prolonged use. Thermally insulated gloves effectively prevent the penetration of steam and help to smoothly iron shirts, coats, jackets, t-shirts and more. Especially it makes ironing collars, sleeves, pockets etc easier and faster.💨Removable Accessories Detachable cloth brush：silk, chiffon, cotton, linen and other fabrics can be used with confidence. Lint brush: remove lint from clothes. Fiber brush: Steam penetrates the texture layer of the fabric to remove dust and hair on the fabric. Warm Tips Water vapor is contained in the water tank because each product has been inspected. The surface temperature is high, do not touch the steam jet head during use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-5G5+AeGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BrightMiracle","source_asin":"B09QHSS2GD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-819607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QHSS2GD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QHSS2GD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
