window.products.push({"id":819954,"name":"MAXROCK Pampas Grass 60Pcs 17.5\" Natural Dried Pampas, 15 White Pampas & 15 Brown Pampas & 30 Pampas, Vase Filler Botanical Fluffy Dried Flowers for H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kxtp6HNlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌾 Natural Dried Flower: Our pampas grass are made from natural high-quality reed grass. Non-toxic and harmless home decor plants. We retain dried pampas grass original color and the feathers are full and even. Natural dried pampas grass do not need to daily care and pruning, which is suitable for all seasons. Here you can feel the charm of nature. 🌾Rich Pampas Grass Decor: 60 pampas grass carefully selected: 15 white pampas and 15 brown pampas and 30 pampas. There are enough quantities for you to choose and you can freely mix and match the style you like to make the most unique art deco bouquet. 🌾 Package & Usage: Put the pampas grass in the sun for 2-3 days to make it fluffy. It is normal about shedding when taken out of the package because it is natural dried plant. Shedding will be minimal once you place in vase. You can also use hairdryer to help pampas grass fluff up the plumes and hair spray to reduce the shedding. 🌾 Perfect Height: The total height of this dry pampas grass is approximately 45cm/17.7\", and the feather section is approximately 33cm/13\". You can also shorten the length of the pampas grass bouquet according to your needs to fit your vase, so as to meet your decorative needs. 🌾 Wonderful Vase Filler: Dried pampas grass is free and comfortable, soft and fluffy, and is a great choice for interior and exterior decorating. Naturally dried pampas grass is suitable for many decorating styles and can be used for parties, family gatherings, boho decor, wedding decor and more. Make a beautiful bouquet for the family and friends you love.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kxtp6HNlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAXROCK","source_asin":"B09872P6MR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-819954","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09872P6MR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09872P6MR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
