window.products.push({"id":819987,"name":"Comfort & Relax 5 Inch Memory Foam Twin XL Mattress for Bunk Bed, Trundle Bed, Day Bed, Light Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31PqroqHsaL._AC_.jpg","description":"COMFORT & RELAX MATTRESS The 5 Inch Memory Foam Mattress will work with most daybeds, trundle beds, and bunk beds, providing conforming comfort with a memory foam layer that molds to the natural shape of your body. The full support foam base layer provides long lasting durability and stability. Pink and green plush cover versions include a moisture barrier. PROBLEMS TO BE SLOVED Our memory foam mattress have been widely used among users of different ages since our mattress can improve their health problems and ease pains, such as neck and cervical pain, snoring, insomnia, cranial neuralgia, stroke and loss of concentration, etc. The memory foam mattress is designed to provide maximum comfort and support for all kinds of sleep positions, including side, back and stomach sleepers. SMARTLY SHIPPED Our patented technology allows our mattress to be efficiently compressed, rolled and shipped in a box conveniently to your door. Please open your mattress package within 72 hours of receipt and allow 48 hours for your new mattress to return to its original, plush shape. WARRANTY AVAILABLE The foam used in this mattress is CertiPUR-US certified, which means it has been independently tested for safety, physical performance and environmental stewardship. This mattress does not contain synthetic or natural latex of any kind. Another comfort innovation from Comfort&Relax. CARE INSTRUCTION In case you experience an odor which is a \"\"Fresh Foam\"\" odor and it is not harmful. The odor should dissipate within 24 hours from when the foam is unpacked and aired out. Store in a Cool and Dry Area Direct away from Sunlight! Measure: Twin xl size (38\"\"W x 80\"\"D x 5\"\"H) Size Option: Twin, Twin-XL, Full Color Option: Girl Pink or Boy Green","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31PqroqHsaL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CR COMFORT & RELAX","source_asin":"B01N4MZ02Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-819987","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N4MZ02Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N4MZ02Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":819988,"name":"Digital Meat Thermometer for Grill and Cooking, Waterproof Instant Read Food Thermometer with Foldable Probe for Deep Fry, Beef Kitchen, BBQ and Roast","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fa4yfdCNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Super Fast and Accurate】It only takes 1-2 seconds to measure temperature, accurate to +/-1 degree, wide range -58℉-572℉. No more waiting for the temperature to stabilize on a hot stove or grill. Find out the exact temperature of your food in a second! For maximum measurement accuracy, a calibration function is provided. Perfect for indoor and outdoor cooking, grilling, grilling and more. 【Easy to use】Out of the box! It's the perfect solution for grilling, baking, measuring bath water, frying, making candy, or use it to test the temperature of your liquids, beer, wine, tea, coffee, baby milk, soup, and more. Digital thermometer with foldable food grade stainless steel probe and auto on/off function, open probe to open, folded probe to close. Easy to use, store and carry. With the included battery, you can start using the thermometer right away. 【Waterproof and Practical】IP67 waterproof, the meat thermometer can be washed under running water, don't worry! With a sturdy ABS plastic body, it can withstand accidental drops or other impacts. The food thermometer has a waterproof and sturdy break-resistant body that is extremely durable and resilient. Great for outdoor barbecues. 【Powerful Features】Easy switching between ℃ and ℉, the large and bright LCD display with backlight makes it very easy to read the temperature when you are cooking outdoors on a sunny day or at night. Easy to calibrate and beautifully packaged in a premium foam-lined box, it's an ideal gift for any cooking or grilling enthusiast. Also includes 1 extra CR 2032 battery, extra meat temperature chart, allowing you to cook mouthwatering meals with ease. 【Warranty】Thank you for your support and trust in our products, so you can buy with confidence. You will have 24 hours * 7 customer service consulting services, safe quality assurance and good after-sales service. We believe you deserve the best.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fa4yfdCNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PEETPEN","source_asin":"B09QMFGGNS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-819988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QMFGGNS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QMFGGNS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
